Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"></span></span><span class="EOP SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW75285851 BCX8" paraid="549479217" paraeid="{5d14ff14-5c54-4162-a8ea-ee5235011159}{154}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: auto 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">1. </span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; font-style: italic; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">Gelijkwaardigheid</span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">: zorg dat de inbreng van elk teamlid gelijke waarde heeft. Wetenschappelijke kennis weegt niet zwaarder dan praktische inzichten. Alle perspectieven moeten samenkomen om nieuwe, uitdagende vragen aan te kunnen pakken.</span><span class="EOP SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW75285851 BCX8" paraid="1058708531" paraeid="{5d14ff14-5c54-4162-a8ea-ee5235011159}{164}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: auto 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; font-style: italic; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">2. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Verantwoordelijkheid en eigenaarschap</span></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">: collectieve verantwoordelijkheid en eigenaarschap sturen </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">transdisciplinaire</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> processen. Alle teamleden moeten het oplossen van het probleem gezamenlijk bekijken en ervaren.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW75285851 BCX8" paraid="1405183429" paraeid="{5d14ff14-5c54-4162-a8ea-ee5235011159}{178}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: auto 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; font-style: italic; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">3. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Vertrouwen en transparantie</span></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">: Bouw vertrouwen op en zorg voor transparantie. Een veilige ruimte is nodig voor een open communicatie tussen de teamleden.</span><span class="EOP SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW75285851 BCX8" paraid="85080289" paraeid="{5d14ff14-5c54-4162-a8ea-ee5235011159}{188}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: auto 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; font-style: italic; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">4. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">B</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">elang van elke deelnemer</span></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">: Elk teamlid moet een eigen belang hebben bij het project, zodat een balans ontstaat tussen ieders bijdragen en opbrengsten. Het uitspreken van je motivatie voor deelname helpt hierbij.</span><span class="EOP SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW75285851 BCX8" paraid="1709441421" paraeid="{5d14ff14-5c54-4162-a8ea-ee5235011159}{200}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: auto 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; font-style: italic; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">5. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Aandacht voor cultuur en communicatie</span></span><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">: Zorg dat je aandacht hebt voor ieders professionele achtergrond en taal. Zo kun je verschillen in waarden, normen, ongeschreven regels en aannames overbruggen.</span><span class="EOP SCXW75285851 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:278}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75285851 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><p class="